Behaviorally, Rottweilers are known for their loyalty, intelligence, and protective nature. They are often used as working dogs, particularly in police and military roles due to their strength and alertness. However, they can also make excellent family pets if properly trained and socialized.

Unique identifying traits of Rottweilers include their characteristic black and tan coloration, muscular build, and friendly yet protective demeanor.
